Description: interactive TCP and UDP port and process monitor
 portop displays local TCP and UDP sockets with their owning processes
 in a live terminal interface. It can associate sockets with systemd
 services and Docker containers, inspect processes and send signals
 after confirmation.
 .
 It also provides JSON snapshots, listening-port baseline comparisons,
 Docker Compose port audits and an optional browser dashboard. Process
 information and actions are subject to the current user's permissions.
